# .cursorignore — Cursor hard block: excludes from AI access AND indexing.
# NOTE (per Cursor docs): this is "best effort". Terminal commands and MCP
# tool calls run OUTSIDE Cursor's file-access controls and may still read
# these files. Keep secrets out of the repo entirely (see SECURITY.md).
#
# The block below is generated from .github/scripts/secret-patterns.txt by
# sync-ignores.mjs. To change it, edit that file and run the script.
# === BEGIN SECURITY FLOOR (generated by sync-ignores.mjs — do not edit) ===
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.keystore
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
*.cert
secrets/
secrets.*
credentials.json
service-account*.json
gha-creds-*.json
application_default_credentials.json
.npmrc.local
# === END SECURITY FLOOR ===
